07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qc1bQpibjk0Q7kNvwHisjlu&_nc_oc=Adr4Ltqw7LZBoozPVpI7-AgrrLfkXJqR0PsKEGzyN8f3tYVdEgLFisACBFSsjNx3QaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL3ITf2QtzJ5YcSPQh358V0Q6_LfyHGDQORw_fqtANCeA&oe=6A9981C2"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ap8GFDjbRdkQ7kNvwFyJoBS&_nc_oc=Adpzag4K8n2VXkCqSkvwWwiXQDDk7xMn_ejYcgqeRY3B8t-QZoXhigAyRbMjaajZTQE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKPOBZ7LF7TYUqj5UEvKwj9WHBqRfRRYRtzO7Tl325sBw&oe=6A99773F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wDPTmCpJOLEQ7kNvwEnCTPo&_nc_oc=Adq3VrvBTSlgGFg3MtBeEWJw4aWXp1IEnRv-NIe8mpyAtB2nGHA6VAHc4fE6OqJpF9M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKHi1EQbUDdGjzee_QQSqBKoTFQMZ633owD4Twq-zCNGQ&oe=6A998630"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic